        "created_at": "2016-01-11T15:35:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Unless Christopher has changed his mind a third time on this topic, the last thing I heard, and the rule I played under all the way to the finals was that Unity's bots could take the same action multiple times in a turn.. hence being able to drop a Raptor Bot and chomp three times.</p>",
