        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"RySmith6\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rysmith6/48/1852_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> RySmith6:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span>Should we start a new thread in the \"Rules\" forum? This seems to have the potential to get… extensive…</span><span></span></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n\n<p><span>That's a great idea.&nbsp; <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slightly_smiling_face.png?v=12\" title=\":slightly_smiling_face:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slightly_smiling_face:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> &nbsp;(And a link, once there's a thread, would be useful for future reference.)</span></p>",
